    html+=start(1)+head(1,t('做完一次版本更新，我想同步发往 X、小红书、公众号、LinkedIn、Reddit 和 Product Hunt。复制粘贴只需三秒，苦头全在后面：通用聊天工具虽然能代笔，但每切一个平台，我都要把产品定位、目标受众和社区潜规则从头交代一遍。一次发布硬生生变成七轮“提示词抽卡”，起草省下的几分钟，全赔进了逐字核对。<br><br>每改完一版，我就记下这遍到底在动什么。记到第七遍，账彻底算清了：一半内容一个字都不能偏——产品名、定价、上线日期与能力边界必须严格锁死；另一半内容却一个词都不能照搬——开场钩子、段落骨架、语气分寸与配图比例必须随社区变形。Finfold 后来全部的信息架构与状态取舍，都在解“锁死事实”与“放活表达”怎样同处一室。','After shipping a release, I set out to share it across X, Xiaohongshu, WeChat, LinkedIn, Reddit and Product Hunt. Copying took three seconds; adapting took hours. A generic chatbot could generate paragraphs, yet every channel meant re-explaining the product, the audience and each community’s unwritten rules from scratch. One launch turned into seven rounds of prompt roulette—and every minute saved on drafting went straight back into fact-checking.<br><br>On each pass, I logged what I was actually fixing. By the seventh rewrite, the work split cleanly in two: facts—product names, pricing, dates and capability limits—could not drift by a single character; form—hooks, pacing, tone and image ratios—had to reshape for every feed. Every architectural and state decision in Finfold comes down to holding fixed facts and fluid expression in one workspace.'))
