    html+=start(3)+head(3,t('拆看市面上做得最扎实的两类代表工具，各自守住了一头：Jasper 擅长沉淀品牌语调，减少反复交代背景；Buffer 擅长排期分发，把跨账号状态收进一张日历。但对独立创始人与精简团队来说，最磨人的是中间那段真空——怎么把今天的一条真实进展，稳稳拆成五六份既不跑偏事实、又符合各平台脾气的成稿？人们依然得在对话框、文档和排期表之间手工搬运。','Look at the strongest tools on either side of the workflow: Jasper anchors consistent brand voice upstream, while Buffer organizes multi-channel calendars and handoffs downstream. Yet for solo founders and lean teams, the hardest stretch sits right in the middle—turning one raw product update into five or six channel-native drafts without distorting a single fact. Users still carried that middle stretch by hand across chat tabs and docs.'))
