    html+=start(4)+head(4,t('我自己的七遍改稿只是单一样本。在用户访谈之外，我还深入跟进了两家行业跨度极大的真实客户：一家在澳大利亚做本地自行车零售（Letour Cycles），看重骑行社区的亲和力与上新节奏；一家做跨境医疗服务（Annoval Medical），每一句专业表述都踩在合规与跨语言信任的红线上。两门生意隔着十万八千里，但一条内容从想法走到公开发出，卡住团队的四道关卡几乎一模一样。','My own seven rewrites were a sample of one. Alongside user interviews, I followed two real client teams at opposite ends of the market: Letour Cycles, an Australian bike retailer rooted in local riding culture, and Annoval Medical, a cross-border healthcare service where accuracy and compliance govern every line. Worlds apart in subject matter—yet every post hit the exact same four checkpoints before going live.'))
