    html+=start(9)+head(9,t('做 AI 产品可用性测试，只看“输入一句话能不能出字”测的是大模型；意外发生后用户能不能兜住，测的才是交互设计。三项走查任务里，我专门拿后两项去撞最容易丢信任的场景：揪出草稿里的偏差并局部修正，以及中途被打断离开后再回来接着干。','Asking whether a prompt returns text only tests the model; testing what happens after things go sideways tests the UX. Out of three usability tasks, two deliberately targeted where AI tools lose trust: catching and fixing a flawed claim in one channel variant, and leaving mid-flow then picking right back up.'))
